#: ../../extending/index.rst:4
msgid "Reach for an extension when behavior belongs **inside** the request lifecycle: restoring history, reshaping context, adding tools, asking the user, or emitting UI events. For display-only callbacks, use an :class:`~zett_agent.dispatcher.AgentEventDispatcher` instead. You never subclass :class:`~zett_agent.agent.Agent` or write a second model loop."
msgstr "当某项行为属于请求生命周期\\ **内部**\\ 时，才应该使用扩展：恢复历史记录、重塑上下文、添加工具、向用户提问，或发出 UI 事件。如果只是用于展示的回调，请改用\\ :class:`~zett_agent.dispatcher.AgentEventDispatcher`\\ 。你永远不需要继承\\ :class:`~zett_agent.agent.Agent`，也不必再写一个模型循环。"

#: ../../extending/index.rst:13
msgid "Write your first extension"
msgstr "编写第一个扩展"

#: ../../extending/index.rst:17
msgid "Register a tool, transform input, emit an event, and clean up."
msgstr "注册工具、转换输入、发出事件并清理。"

#: ../../extending/index.rst:23
msgid "Sessions, compaction, subagents, approvals, skills, MCP, and more."
msgstr "会话、压缩、子智能体、审批、技能、MCP 等。"

#: ../../extending/index.rst:25
msgid "Lifecycle hooks"
msgstr "生命周期钩子"

#: ../../extending/index.rst:29
msgid "Every hook boundary and which one to override for a given job."
msgstr "每个钩子边界，以及针对具体任务应该覆盖哪一个。"

#: ../../extending/index.rst:35
msgid "Wrap each provider request or tool call, in a documented order."
msgstr "按文档说明的顺序包装每次模型提供商请求或工具调用。"

#: ../../extending/index.rst:37
msgid "Events and external input"
msgstr "事件与外部输入"

#: ../../extending/index.rst:41
msgid "Publish notifications and route responses back into a running request."
msgstr "发布通知，并把响应送回正在运行的请求。"

#: ../../extending/index.rst:47
msgid "Keep per-request data safe when one instance serves many sessions."
msgstr "在一个实例服务多个会话时，保证各请求数据的安全。"

#: ../../extending/index.rst:53
msgid "Add a provider or normalize a protocol the built-ins do not cover."
msgstr "添加模型提供商，或规范化内置实现未覆盖的协议。"

#: ../../extending/index.rst:55
msgid "Server-side tools"
msgstr "服务端工具"

#: ../../extending/index.rst:59
msgid "Declare provider-hosted tools such as web search or code execution."
msgstr "声明模型提供商托管的工具，例如网页搜索或代码执行。"

#: ../../extending/index.rst:65
msgid "Persist raw history and compaction checkpoints in your own store."
msgstr "把原始历史记录和压缩检查点持久化到你自己的存储中。"

#: ../../extending/index.rst:67
msgid "Suggested path: build your first extension, learn the event channels, then add state and cancellation handling. Implement a new provider or storage adapter only when an existing one cannot satisfy your application boundary."
msgstr "建议的路径：先编写第一个扩展，了解事件通道，然后加入状态与取消处理。只有当现有的模型提供商或存储适配器无法满足你的应用边界时，才去实现新的。"

